As I recall, Bard's arrow was just called the 'black arrow.'  He also
made a comment about always retrieving it after he fired it, so I
think the arrow would have to remain after every shot, like a thrown
hand-to-hand weapon does.  (Of course, one of those Uruk-Hai could
pick it up from his comrade's body, and . . . give it back to you.

